			(property "Description" "Low-voltage 16-bit I2C-bus I/O port with interrupt and Agile I/O, TSSOP-24; pin-to-pin replacement for PCA9535/PCA9535A/TCA9535"
				(at 0 0 0)
				(hide yes)
