		(property "Note2" "SOURCING 2026-08-23 (FBV2-S2-002) (B-71) - FIRST-BUILD BLOCKER. NXP PCAL9535APW,118 is LCSC C2669683 with STOCK 1 against a need of FIFTEEN (three per board, five boards). This part cannot be JLC-turnkey-sourced today. Buy fifteen plus spares from a broadline distributor and CONSIGN them to JLC so they stay MACHINE-PLACED - a TSSOP-24 at 0.65 mm pitch, fifteen times, is not a hand-assembly job. LCSC/JLC library state verified live on 2026-08-23 through the JLCPCB parts API (D-096). Stock is a snapshot, not a guarantee."
			(at 167.64 74.93 0)
			(hide yes)
