				)
			)
		)
		(property "Note2" "SOURCING 2026-08-23 (FBV2-S2-002) (B-71). Genuine C&K PTS645SM43SMTR92LFS is LCSC C221880, stock 8432. A loose keyword search returns G-Switch GT-TC089A-H043-L1 (C843623) instead - a DIFFERENT MANUFACTURER whose land pattern has not been checked against the C&K G-Type layout this footprint was built from. Seven buttons per board is 35 placements for the first five; do not let a search shortcut swap them. LCSC/JLC library state verified live on 2026-08-23 through the JLCPCB parts API (D-096). Stock is a snapshot, not a guarantee."
			(at 82.55 153.67 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
