	(text "USER BUTTONS - PTS645 FAMILY LOCKED\n\nC&K / Littelfuse PTS645, 6x6 mm SMD, top-actuated\nFOOTPRINT LOCKED (VERIFIED_VENDOR_EXACT vs C&K PCB LAYOUT)\nBOM SUFFIX VERIFY AT BOM LOCK\n\nSELECTION TARGETS: 160 gf, ~5 mm actuator,\n~0.25 mm travel, 100k operation class\n\nENCLOSURE DESIGN TARGETS (NOT SWITCH SPECS):\nindividual plastic caps, no membrane for Beta\n0.1-0.3 mm rest gap, no preload\nhard stop at ~0.3-0.4 mm total cap travel\n\nSW1 is the ESP32 BOOT strap button and takes no cap."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
