		(property "Note" "BLUE channel current-set resistor, FBV2-S1-008. VF ~ 2.60 V at ~1.7 mA from the data-sheet Fig. 4 curve (the 2.7 to 3.4 V table figure is at 20 mA). 1.67 mA nominal, 2.17 mA high corner, 0.86 mA low corner. Blue gets the MOST current of the three because it is the dimmest die - 500 mcd typ at 20 mA against 1685 for green - which brings the three channels to roughly 80 / 87 / 42 mcd and gives a usable white through a diffuser. This is indicator balance, not colorimetry."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
